---
title: InventoryCountSession State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : count session created by warehouse, zone or SKU scope
    Draft --> Counting : session started, system quantities snapshotted
    Draft --> Cancelled : cancel before counting
    Counting --> Counting : Warehouse Keeper scans and enters actual quantities
    Counting --> PendingApproval : count submitted, variances calculated
    PendingApproval --> Approved : authorized approver accepts variances
    PendingApproval --> Counting : approver requests recount
    Approved --> Posted : AdjustmentIncrease/AdjustmentDecrease transactions posted with reason and audit log
    Posted --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
